      "about": "Your records (#127; the relay's record notifications port the same rules in #134). Input: `you` and each rival as {YYYY-MM-DD: n} calendars, read in `timeZone`; `asOf` is the local day at `now` in `timeZone` (today). Only your calendar's days from its first day through today count: a missing day is 0, a later day never counts. Rivals are the people on your board now (hidden people are left out before this). A week is Monday to Sunday in `timeZone`. Ties with an old best never set a record, and when several days, weeks, runs or windows share the best, the earliest is the record (it set it first). bestDay: the most in one day. bestWeek: the most in one week (this week counts so far). longestStreak: the most days in a row with a contribution. best30Days: the most in any 30 days in a row ending on a day through today. Each is null while it's 0, else {value, first, last (day keys), new}; a week's first and last are its Monday and Sunday. `new` (the tile's New badge): bestDay and best30Days end today; bestWeek is this week; longestStreak's run ends today. daysAtNumberOne: null without a rival, else {value: days you had more than 0 and at least as many as every rival, last: the most recent such day or null}. firstWeekAtNumberOne: null without a rival, else {week: the first finished week (its Sunday before today) you had more than 0 and at least as many as every rival, or null; new: that week is last week; rankThisWeek: 1 + rivals with more than you this week so far}. `set` lists the records broken today, in the order bestDay, bestWeek, longestStreak: the record card and record notifications fire only for these, once. bestDay is set when today beats every earlier day; bestWeek when this week through yesterday was at most the best earlier week and through today beats it; longestStreak when today has a contribution and today's run is exactly one day longer than the longest run that ended before it began. `oldBest` is that earlier best, with its first and last day, or null when there was none (nothing above 0). `meetsMinimum`: an old best day of at least 5; an old best week of at least 1 (there must be one to name); an old longest streak of at least 7 days. The card and notification need it.",
